WEBVTT

00:00.173 --> 00:01.724
Hello, Zcash community!

00:01.801 --> 00:04.006
Here’s how to vote with ZODL on your
phone.

00:04.272 --> 00:06.432
In Settings, tap Beta Coinholder Polling.

00:06.672 --> 00:09.594
Find the NU7.1 poll, then tap Enter Poll.

00:09.838 --> 00:10.659
Tap Start Voting.

00:10.781 --> 00:13.410
For each proposal, choose your answer and
tap Next.

00:13.682 --> 00:16.681
This proposal would wind down ZCG and end
new grants.

00:16.864 --> 00:18.259
Grants already awarded would continue,

00:18.419 --> 00:21.122
with payments made as agreed milestones
are met.

00:21.398 --> 00:23.874
After covering existing grants and wind-
down costs,

00:23.995 --> 00:27.515
remaining funds would go to the Future Dev
and Legal Defense Fund lockbox.

00:27.914 --> 00:31.679
If ZCG’s 8% funding stream is still active
when the upgrade takes effect,

00:31.785 --> 00:35.062
it would go to that lockbox until the
November 2028 halving.

00:35.350 --> 00:39.833
This proposal would redirect ZCG’s 8%
funding stream to a new Future Dev and

00:39.846 --> 00:43.969
Legal Defense Fund lockbox requiring
community approval for disbursements,

00:44.187 --> 00:48.210
require ZCG to contribute 50,000 ZEC to
the NSM,

00:48.223 --> 00:52.319
and preserve ZCG and its grant program
with its remaining treasury.

00:52.582 --> 00:57.446
This proposal would retain ZCG’s existing
treasury and continue its 8%

00:57.459 --> 00:59.539
funding stream through November 2028.

00:59.867 --> 01:03.995
It would rename the grant program and its
pool of funds to Zcash Adoption

01:04.008 --> 01:08.181
Pool, consistent with using those funds to
increase Zcash and ZEC adoption

01:08.360 --> 01:09.486
as broadly as possible.

01:09.767 --> 01:13.294
It would also leave open the possibility
of using funds from the existing

01:13.306 --> 01:16.026
treasury for development and legal
defense.

01:16.316 --> 01:17.833
This is the status quo option.

01:17.989 --> 01:22.617
ZCG would continue receiving its 8%
funding stream through the November 2028

01:22.713 --> 01:25.945
halving, and its treasury and operations
would remain unchanged.

01:26.216 --> 01:28.488
Assuming it can be done safely in a
network upgrade,

01:28.731 --> 01:31.982
do you support reducing Zcash’s target
block time from 25 seconds to 20

01:31.995 --> 01:32.366
seconds?

01:32.638 --> 01:35.282
Once you’ve checked your answers, tap
Confirm & Submit.

01:35.538 --> 01:37.361
Read the authorization and tap Confirm.

01:37.605 --> 01:39.866
Keep ZODL open while it sends your vote.

01:40.105 --> 01:42.164
When you see Submission Confirmed, tap
Done.

01:42.405 --> 01:44.318
Thanks for helping shape the future of
Zcash.

01:44.430 --> 01:44.986
Happy voting!
